  "verseCount": 17,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "7",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PSA 7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "7",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "d"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shiggaion of David, which he sang unto the",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", concerning the words of Cush the Benjamite.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.7.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.7.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "my God, in thee do I put my trust: save me from all them that persecute me, and deliver me:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.7.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lest he tear my soul like a lion, rending",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.7.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.7.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in pieces, while",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.7.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.7.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "none to deliver.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.7.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.7.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.7.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "my God, if I have done this; if there be iniquity in my hands;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.7.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If I have rewarded evil unto him that was at peace with me; (yea, I have delivered him that without cause is mine enemy:)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.7.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let the enemy persecute my soul, and take",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it;",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.7.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.7.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yea, let him tread down my life upon the earth, and lay mine honour in the dust. Selah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.7.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arise, O",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.7.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.7.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", in thine anger, lift up thyself because of the rage of mine enemies: and awake for me",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "to",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.7.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.7.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the judgment",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.7.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.7.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thou hast commanded.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.7.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So shall the congregation of the people compass thee about: for their sakes therefore return thou on high.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.7.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.7.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.7.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall judge the people: judge me, O",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.7.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.7.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", according to my righteousness, and according to mine integrity",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.7.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.7.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.7.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oh let the wickedness of the wicked come to an end; but establish the just: for the righteous God trieth the hearts and reins.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.7.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "My defence",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.7.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.7.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of God, which saveth the upright in heart.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.7.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God judgeth the righteous, and God is angry",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "with the wicked",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.7.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.7.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "every day.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.7.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If he turn not, he will whet his sword; he hath bent his bow, and made it ready.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.7.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He hath also prepared for him the instruments of death; he ordaineth his arrows against the persecutors.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.7.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, he travaileth with iniquity, and hath conceived mischief, and brought forth falsehood.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.7.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He made a pit, and digged it, and is fallen into the ditch",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "which",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.7.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.7.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he made.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.7.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "His mischief shall return upon his own head, and his violent dealing shall come down upon his own pate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.7.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will praise the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.7.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.7.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "according to his righteousness: and will sing praise to the name of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.7.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.7.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
